* Add check for stropts.h header and updwtmpx func. 
* Add check for ut_session in struct utmpx.
* Fix broken Xlocale support
* Use posix_openpt() to avoid GNUisms. 

--- configure.orig	2003-03-26 06:07:26.000000000 +0000
+++ configure
@@ -9481,6 +9481,7 @@ fi
 
 
 
+
 for ac_header in \
